### Pariose Backend - Authentication API Tests
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Register new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "testuser2",
  "password": "Test1234",
  "noms": "Doe",
  "prenoms": "Jane",
  "contact_1": "9876543210",
  "addresse": "456 Oak Avenue"
}

### 2. Login with credentials
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### 3. Get user profile (requires token from login)
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Test with invalid credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}

### 6. Test registration with duplicate username
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### 7. Test registration with weak password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "weakpass",
  "password": "123"
}

### 8. Test profile without token (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile

### 9. Test profile with invalid token (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here
